---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="LubandArt Tape — 专业胶带与胶粘解决方案制造商">
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container hero-inner">
      <div>
        <h1>专业<span class="hl">胶粘解决方案</span><br />让每一次粘接都更可靠</h1>
        <p>
          LubandArt Tape 专注于双面胶、泡棉胶带、工业胶带与高温胶带的研发与制造，
          为电子、汽车、包装、建筑等行业提供稳定可靠的粘接方案。
        </p>
        <div class="hero-cta">
          <a class="btn" href="#products">查看产品</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#quote">获取报价</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-visual">
        <span class="tag">核心能力</span>
        <ul>
          <li><span>厚度公差控制</span><span>±0.01mm</span></li>
          <li><span>耐温范围</span><span>-40~260℃</span></li>
          <li><span>初粘 / 持粘</span><span>行业领先</span></li>
          <li><span>定制分切</span><span>支持</span></li>
          <li><span>环保认证</span><span>RoHS</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Products -->
  <section id="products">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="eyebrow">Products</div>
        <h2>产品中心</h2>
        <p>覆盖多场景的胶粘产品矩阵，支持按规格、基材与用途定制。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="card product-card">
          <img src="/products/acrylic.jpg" alt="Double Sided Acrylic Tape" class="product-img" loading="lazy" />
          <h3>双面亚克力胶</h3>
          <p class="en">Double Sided Acrylic Tape</p>
          <p>高初粘、耐候抗老化，适用于汽车外饰、铭牌固定与精密结构粘接。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card product-card">
          <img src="/products/eva.jpg" alt="Double Sided EVA Tape" class="product-img" loading="lazy" />
          <h3>EVA 双面胶</h3>
          <p class="en">Double Sided EVA Tape</p>
          <p>缓冲密封、填缝减震，泡棉基材柔韧服帖，包装与工业组装常用。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card product-card">
          <img src="/products/opp.jpg" alt="Double Sided OPP Tape" class="product-img" loading="lazy" />
          <h3>OPP 双面胶</h3>
          <p class="en">Double Sided OPP Tape</p>
          <p>高强度捆绑、线束固定与封缄，性价比之选，通用粘接可靠。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card product-card">
          <img src="/products/pe-foam.jpg" alt="Double Sided PE Foam Tape" class="product-img" loading="lazy" />
          <h3>PE 泡棉双面胶</h3>
          <p class="en">Double Sided PE Foam Tape</p>
          <p>缓冲密封、填缝减震，汽车与建筑密封、镜面安装首选。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card product-card">
          <img src="/products/pet.jpg" alt="Double Sided PET Tape" class="product-img" loading="lazy" />
          <h3>PET 双面胶</h3>
          <p class="en">Double Sided PET Tape</p>
          <p>超薄、尺寸稳定，电子屏贴、铭牌与塑料件精密固定。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card product-card">
          <img src="/products/pvc.jpg" alt="Double Sided PVC Tape" class="product-img" loading="lazy" />
          <h3>PVC 双面胶</h3>
          <p class="en">Double Sided PVC Tape</p>
          <p>贴合绝缘、轻量固定，适用于线材、标牌与表面保护。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card product-card">
          <img src="/products/tissue.jpg" alt="Double Sided Tissue Tape" class="product-img" loading="lazy" />
          <h3>棉纸双面胶</h3>
          <p class="en">Double Sided Tissue Tape</p>
          <p>易模切、服帖性好，laminating 与通用轻粘接场景。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- About + Stats -->
  <section id="about" style="background:var(--bg-soft)">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="eyebrow">About</div>
        <h2>关于我们</h2>
        <p>十余年胶粘行业深耕，集研发、生产、分切、品控于一体，服务全球客户。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid" style="grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr; align-items:center; gap:3rem">
        <div>
          <p style="color:var(--fg-soft)">
            LubandArt Tape 拥有完善的生产线与实验室检测能力，从基材选型、涂布工艺到分切包装全流程管控。
            我们坚持稳定的品质与快速的交付，帮助客户降低综合成本、提升产品可靠性。
          </p>
          <p style="color:var(--fg-soft)">
            无论是标准规格还是非标定制，我们都可提供样品打样、技术选型与批量供货的一体化服务。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); gap:1.2rem">
          <div class="card"><div class="stat"><div class="num">10+</div><div class="lbl">年行业经验</div></div></div>
          <div class="card"><div class="stat"><div class="num">500+</div><div class="lbl">合作客户</div></div></div>
          <div class="card"><div class="stat"><div class="num">2000+</div><div class="lbl">产品规格</div></div></div>
          <div class="card"><div class="stat"><div class="num">30+</div><div class="lbl">出口国家</div></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Advantages -->
  <section id="advantages">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="eyebrow">Why Us</div>
        <h2>核心优势</h2>
        <p>从品质到服务，构建可持续的供应链合作。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="card feature">
          <div class="dot">1</div>
          <div><h3>品质稳定</h3><p>全流程品控与批次追溯，关键指标可检测、可复现。</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="card feature">
          <div class="dot">2</div>
          <div><h3>快速打样</h3><p>技术团队响应迅速，支持非标定制与小批量试产。</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="card feature">
          <div class="dot">3</div>
          <div><h3>柔性供应</h3><p>多基地协同，交期可控，支持长期框架合作。</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="card feature">
          <div class="dot">4</div>
          <div><h3>技术支持</h3><p>提供选型建议、应用测试与售后跟踪服务。</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Industries -->
  <section id="industries" style="background:var(--bg-soft)">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="eyebrow">Industries</div>
        <h2>行业解决方案</h2>
        <p>从汽车到电子，为各行业提供定制化的粘接、密封与缓冲方案。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="card industry-card">
          <div class="ico">🚗</div>
          <h3>汽车</h3>
          <p>外饰件、徽标、内饰结构粘接，耐候抗老化，适应严苛车规环境。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card industry-card">
          <div class="ico">🏢</div>
          <h3>建筑</h3>
          <p>中空玻璃、幕墙填缝与结构粘接，长期稳定，安装更高效。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card industry-card">
          <div class="ico">🔌</div>
          <h3>家电</h3>
          <p>面板固定、减震与热管理，提升装配效率与产品可靠性。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card industry-card">
          <div class="ico">⚙️</div>
          <h3>机械工业</h3>
          <p>设备组装、密封与长期户外防护，承载工业级应用需求。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card industry-card">
          <div class="ico">🪧</div>
          <h3>标识</h3>
          <p>室内外招牌安装，隐形固定、强持粘，呈现更整洁的视觉效果。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card industry-card">
          <div class="ico">📱</div>
          <h3>电子</h3>
          <p>超薄双面胶与导热粘接，服务智能设备与显示屏精密组装。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Certifications & Reports -->
  <section id="certifications">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="eyebrow">Quality</div>
        <h2>资质认证与检测报告</h2>
        <p>完善的质量体系与第三方检测报告，为长期稳定供货提供保障。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="card cert-card">
          <div class="ico">📜</div>
          <h3>ISO 9001:2015</h3>
          <p>质量管理体系认证，<a href="/certs/iso-9001.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">下载证书 ↗</a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="card cert-card">
          <div class="ico">♻️</div>
          <h3>RoHS 合规</h3>
          <p>材料符合RoHS有害物质限制指令，可下载检测报告。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card cert-card">
          <div class="ico">🌿</div>
          <h3>REACH 合规</h3>
          <p>符合REACH化学品注册、评估与授权要求。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card cert-card">
          <div class="ico">🔍</div>
          <h3>SGS 审核</h3>
          <p>第三方审核供应商，生产体系可验证。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card cert-card">
          <div class="ico">🧪</div>
          <h3>自建实验室</h3>
          <p>初粘、持粘、剥离、老化等关键指标可检测。</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h3 style="margin:2.5rem 0 1rem">检测报告下载</h3>
      <ul class="report-list">
        <li><a href="/reports/pe-foam-rohs.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="pdf-ico">PDF</span> PE Foam Tape — RoHS Report</a></li>
        <li><a href="/reports/pet-rohs.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="pdf-ico">PDF</span> PET Tape — RoHS Report</a></li>
        <li><a href="/reports/pe-foam-uv-aging.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="pdf-ico">PDF</span> PE Foam Tape — UV Aging Test</a></li>
        <li><a href="/reports/pet-tape-rohs.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="pdf-ico">PDF</span> 双面 PET 胶带 — RoHS 报告</a></li>
        <li><a href="/reports/pe-foam-tape-rohs.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="pdf-ico">PDF</span> 双面 PE 泡棉胶带 — RoHS 报告</a></li>
        <li><a href="/reports/flame-retardant-tissue-rohs.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="pdf-ico">PDF</span> 阻燃棉纸胶带 — RoHS 报告</a></li>
        <li><a href="/reports/low-odor-tissue-odor.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="pdf-ico">PDF</span> 低气味棉纸胶带 — 气味检测报告</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Quote -->
  <section id="quote" class="contact">
    <div class="container contact-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="section-head" style="text-align:left; margin:0 0 1.5rem">
          <div class="eyebrow">Quote</div>
          <h2>获取报价</h2>
          <p>告诉我们您的应用场景与规格，我们将尽快提供选型建议与报价。</p>
        </div>
        <ul class="contact-info">
          <li><strong>邮箱：</strong> sales@lubandart-tape.com</li>
          <li><strong>电话：</strong> +86 400-000-0000</li>
          <li><strong>地址：</strong> 中国 · 胶粘产业园 A 区</li>
          <li><strong>工作时间：</strong> 周一至周五 9:00–18:00</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="margin-top:1.5rem; color:var(--fg-soft)">也可以直接点击右下角 <strong>AI 客服</strong>，实时咨询产品信息。</p>
      </div>
      <form class="quote-form" onsubmit="return false">
        <input type="text" placeholder="您的称呼" />
        <input type="text" placeholder="公司名称" />
        <input type="email" placeholder="邮箱 / 电话" class="full" />
        <select class="full">
          <option value="">请选择产品类型</option>
          <option>双面亚克力胶</option>
          <option>PE 泡棉双面胶</option>
          <option>PET 双面胶</option>
          <option>棉纸双面胶</option>
          <option>EVA 双面胶</option>
          <option>OPP 双面胶</option>
          <option>PVC 双面胶</option>
          <option>其他 / 定制</option>
        </select>
        <input type="text" placeholder="规格尺寸（如 宽10mm 厚0.1mm）" />
        <input type="text" placeholder="预计用量" />
        <textarea placeholder="请描述您的需求，例如：需要 0.1mm 双面胶，宽 10mm，用量 5000 卷" class="full"></textarea>
        <button class="btn full" type="submit">获取报价</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Contact -->
  <section id="contact">
    <div class="container contact-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="section-head" style="text-align:left; margin:0 0 1.5rem">
          <div class="eyebrow">Contact</div>
          <h2>联系方式</h2>
          <p>欢迎来电、邮件或通过下方表单咨询，我们将尽快回复。</p>
        </div>
        <ul class="contact-info">
          <li><strong>邮箱：</strong> sales@lubandart-tape.com</li>
          <li><strong>电话：</strong> +86 400-000-0000</li>
          <li><strong>地址：</strong> 中国 · 胶粘产业园 A 区</li>
          <li><strong>工作时间：</strong> 周一至周五 9:00–18:00</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <form class="contact-form" onsubmit="return false">
        <input type="text" placeholder="您的称呼" />
        <input type="email" placeholder="邮箱 / 电话" />
        <textarea placeholder="请描述您的需求，例如：需要 0.1mm 双面胶，宽 10mm，用量 5000 卷"></textarea>
        <button class="btn" type="submit">提交咨询</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .product-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 170px;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    background: var(--bg-soft);
  }
  .product-card .en {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.3px;
    margin: -0.3rem 0 0.6rem;
  }
  .industry-card .ico,
  .cert-card .ico {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: rgba(246, 130, 31, 0.12);
    color: var(--accent);
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .cert-card a { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; }
  .report-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }
  .report-list li a {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 10px;
    color: var(--fg);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    transition: border-color 0.2s, color 0.2s;
  }
  .report-list li a:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .report-list .pdf-ico {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 1px 6px;
  }
  .quote-form {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 0.9rem;
  }
  .quote-form .full { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
  .quote-form input,
  .quote-form select,
  .quote-form textarea {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 0.8rem 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 10px;
    font: inherit;
    background: #fff;
  }
  .quote-form textarea { min-height: 110px; resize: vertical; }
  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .quote-form { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
